; --v is scored through two layers, so on the paper it is two perpendicular
; stretches. Only one of them reaches --ab, and the meet is that crossing.
paper square
fold (map .c onto .a) (moving .c)
mark (map .b onto .a) as --v
.mid = --v * --ab

